# Shell scripts are LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says locally.
#
# The box runs them, and a shebang ending "bash\r" fails there as "bad
# interpreter" rather than as a line-ending problem. core.fileMode is false
# on the development machines, so the executable bit needs the same care:
# set it with `git update-index --chmod=+x` and check it with
# `git ls-tree HEAD`, never `git ls-files`, which reads the index.
*.sh text eol=lf
deploy/migrations text eol=lf
entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
